flowchart LR
    A[旧局部跟踪失败]:::fail --> B[GT bbox 与冻结 OSNet]:::input
    B --> C[成熟 BoT-SORT 生命周期]:::method
    C --> D1[无 GMC 无外观]:::ablation
    C --> D2[GMC]:::ablation
    C --> D3[OSNet]:::ablation
    C --> D4[GMC 加 OSNet]:::ablation
    D1 --> E{局部轨迹就绪门}:::gate
    D2 --> E
    D3 --> E
    D4 --> E
    E -->|通过| F[进入异步全局轨迹片段融合]:::next
    E -->|失败| G[转向专门的移动相机跟踪器]:::fail

    P[当前位置<br>代码完成 等待 Pilot]:::current -.-> C
    R[通过标准<br>IDF1 纯度 最差视角 遮挡覆盖]:::note -.-> E

    classDef input fill:#f2f2f2,stroke:#555,color:#111
    classDef method fill:#eef5ff,stroke:#4f78a8,color:#172536
    classDef ablation fill:#fff,stroke:#888,color:#222
    classDef gate fill:#fff4df,stroke:#b77a22,stroke-width:2px,color:#332100
    classDef next fill:#eef8ed,stroke:#4f8a54,color:#143018
    classDef fail fill:#fff1f1,stroke:#b65757,color:#351616
    classDef current fill:#ffe6cc,stroke:#cc5500,stroke-width:3px,color:#241000
    classDef note fill:#fff,stroke:#999,stroke-dasharray:4 3,color:#222

